  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">必須安裝高清修復模組（OptiFine）</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此資源包會調整光照等級，讓您的麥塊角色在任何環境（包括終界與地獄）都能保持清晰視野！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">多數</span></em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">伺服器允許使用全亮資源包，因其實際並不會帶來明顯優勢。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">全球已有超過2億名麥塊玩家使用全亮資源包。</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_iZEpKvaXD8?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">支援版本：1.7 至 1.17！</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">重要提醒！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">若需下載<strong>1.6 - 1.12版本</strong>，請勿僅下載首個檔案，務必同時下載補充檔案，這些檔案可直接運作無需調整。</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">不包含夜視藥水粒子效果。</span></em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">全亮資源包下載與安裝教學：</span></em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iDicbnZaM08?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></em></span></p>",
